{"id":"d530952583f9f96d","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-atlas.md","title":"Atlas","display":"df-atlas — Atlas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-atlas","aliases":["58-df-atlas"],"display":"df-atlas — Atlas","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-atlas"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-atlas</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atlas — Atlas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal A,n\\in V\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(M,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal A,n\\in V\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chart}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chart}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f9e7fe466acfa12\" href=\"?note=3f9e7fe466acfa12\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-chart.md\">../batch01/58-df-chart.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Atlas}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Atlas}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atlas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\mathcal T)\\land M=\\bigcup\\{U\\mid\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;(\\langle U,W,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;(c=\\langle U,W,\\varphi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\varphi,M,\\mathcal T,n))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}atlas} \\vdash \\mathrm{Atlas}_S(\\mathcal A,M,\\mathcal T,n)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(M,\\mathcal T)\\land M=\\bigcup\\{U\\mid\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;(\\langle U,W,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A)\\}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\exists U\\in\\mathcal T\\;\\exists W\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\;(c=\\langle U,W,\\varphi\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Chart}_S(U,W,\\varphi,M,\\mathcal T,n))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An atlas is a compatible chart family covering the underlying space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-chart.md","status":"resolved","id":"3f9e7fe466acfa12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-chart.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12